{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the mysteries of history in &quot;World Wonders: Hidden Secrets&quot;, a captivating hidden object game. Journey to awe-inspiring locales like Egypt's pyramids and Cambodia's ancient temples. Each level unfolding a new historical era. This game skillfully blends traditional hidden object puzzles with a variety of other challenges, offering a rich, immersive experience. Earn coins to collect and display historical artifacts, and unlock Codex entries for deeper insights into each civilization's history and culture. &quot;World Wonders: Hidden Secrets&quot; is a unique blend of entertainment and education, perfect for those who love puzzles and the mysteries of our past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect priceless artifacts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover history and culture!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit ancient places!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try different puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wind hidden items!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore photos of important places!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find all the differences!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore broken artifacts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colour the pictures!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2926670?t=1753989839","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2926670?t=1753989839","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926670/1bb6cf5b334f5c0f083fed906a73912416a218c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753989839","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2926670/1bb6cf5b334f5c0f083fed906a73912416a218c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753989839","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sha